Add bindings for defining a OS-Initiated based CPU PM domain.

Cc: <devicetree-u79uwXL29TY76Z2rM5mHXA@public.gmane.org>
Cc: Lorenzo Pieralisi <lorenzo.pieralisi-5wv7dgnIgG8@public.gmane.org>
